:84,"info":85},"Misc Papers","Curated shortlist of continual-learning & AI papers — bite-sized takeaways.",["Date","2025-08-15T00:00:00.000Z"],[86],{"text":43,"icon":87},{"type":45,"name":46},"### Elastic Weight Consolidation  \n\u003C!-- \u003Csmall>[arXiv:1612.00796](https://arxiv.org/abs/1612.00796)\u003C/small> -->\n\nSelectively slows learning on parameters critical to earlier tasks, reducing catastrophic forgetting via a quadratic regulariser.\n\n---\n\n### iCaRL – Incremental Classifier and Representation Learning  \n\u003C!-- \u003Csmall>[arXiv:1611.07725](https://arxiv.org/abs/1611.07725)\u003C/small> -->\n\nLearns new classes incrementally with exemplar rehearsal + nearest-mean classifier; no catastrophic forgetting.\n\n---\n\n### Learning without Forgetting  \n\u003C!-- \u003Csmall>[arXiv:1606.09282](https://arxiv.org/abs/1606.09282)\u003C/small> -->\n\nUses knowledge distillation to preserve performance on old tasks while training on new tasks — no access to old data.","src/content/projects/misc-papers.md","84a48ae974b5f2be",{"html":92,"metadata":93},"\u003Ch3 id=\"elastic-weight-consolidation\">Elastic Weight Consolidation\u003C/h3>\n\u003C!-- \u003Csmall>[arXiv:1612.00796](https://arxiv.org/abs/1612.00796)\u003C/small> -->\n\u003Cp>Selectively slows learning on parameters critical to earlier tasks, reducing catastrophic forgetting via a quadratic regulariser.\u003C/p>\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"icarl--incremental-classifier-and-representation-learning\">iCaRL – Incremental Classifier and Representation Learning\u003C/h3>\n\u003C!-- \u003Csmall>[arXiv:1611.07725](https://arxiv.org/abs/1611.07725)\u003C/small> -->\n\u003Cp>Learns new classes incrementally with exemplar rehearsal + nearest-mean classifier; no catastrophic forgetting.\u003C/p>\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"learning-without-forgetting\">Learning without Forgetting\u003C/h3>\n\u003C!-- \u003Csmall>[arXiv:1606.09282](https://arxiv.org/abs/1606.09282)\u003C/small> -->\n\u003Cp>Uses knowledge distil